00:01:14.883 --> 00:01:18.803
Avoid vanity work that feels busy but does not create proof.

00:01:18.803 --> 00:01:23.080
If something is unclear, simplify the promise and try a smaller version.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:27.960
Write your first week plan as four short bullets you can actually keep.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.766
Remember the objective: describe your first week plan.

00:01:30.766 --> 00:01:34.625
